{"game": "helldivers-2", "language": "schinese", "appid": 553850, "month": "2024-06", "window": 3, "start_date": 1718496000, "end_date": 1719187199, "month_true_total": 650, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:27:13 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "168049014", "author": {"steamid": "76561198365335399", "personaname": "瘦巴巴的老爷们儿", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198365335399/", "num_games_owned": 143, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 3813, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1003, "last_played": 1740393323, "avatar": "b73c661b4c1286030ceec699ecd5d64610fa4c5c"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "虽然是孤狼 但是玩的很nice", "timestamp_created": 1719186777, "timestamp_updated": 1719186777, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "168026590", "author": {"steamid": "76561198857234050", "personaname": "Li", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198857234050/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 8139, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3540, "last_played": 1776791034, "avatar": "86d68657251fc5d3ee4b07a19d651fc26b8c0f33"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "[h1] PlayStation控制器特性高度支持 [/h1]\n若你拥有DualShok 4或DualSense,则高度推荐体验此产品。\n此产品高度支持PlayStation无线控制器的特性，比如DualSense的细腻震动效果和扳机力度反馈效果等，其中值得一提的是它允许你使用触控板来控制地图指针。\n\n[h1] 面向世界 [/h1]\n该产品是典型的多人合作PVE游戏,独特在于其针对新手而言十分富有挑战性的交互方式，此特色十分利好人际关系增长。\n你会在游戏过程中遇到来自世界各地的玩家，你需要掌握一定英语口语才能进行基本交流；有时网络会十分卡顿（即使你的网络质量高），这是正常现象，因为该游戏的网络沟通高度依赖对局主办者的网络质量。\n\n[h1] PlayStation Network账户相关事项 [/h1]\n此产品支援PlayStation4和PlayStation5,在开启跨平台合作功能后便可以和PSN用户一同游玩,你也可以在游戏内与他们添加好友,即使你并未拥有PSN账户。\n[b] 需要注意的是，此产品的发行商曾经强制要求玩家将他们的Steam账户与PSN账户绑定，这曾导致许多地区的玩家无法使用此产品，但目前此要求是可选的，因此不需要担心非中国大陆地区PSN账户的注册困难。 [/b]\n\n[h1] 次世代音频渲染技术 [/h1]\n游戏主机的主要市场在于家庭影院，从PS 3开始，市面上的各种游戏主机基本也都支持了完整的家庭影院环绕声输出（PCM、DDP、DTS 5.1~7.1），如今的次世代音频技术聚焦于对象音频，具体的商标有DTS:X和Dolby Atmos等，后者普及率更高。\n\n此产品的音频渲染基于Wwise Engine,得益于之,整个游戏过程中的音频定位十分精确,不过,这需要你拥有经过校准的多声道（至少4声道）扬声器监听系统或是基于个性化虚拟空间音频的耳机；不过此产品的音频设置并没有其它PS Studio发行产品全面。\n*此产品在Windows客户端上不支援Dolby Atmos输出。\n\n此产品售价比较高昂，在PS Store HK中售价为568 HKD，Steam中国大陆地区售价为198 RMB，因此，你可能不太容易在身边找到关系较好的冻肉朋友。", "timestamp_created": 1719164729, "timestamp_updated": 1751229506, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "168017975", "author": {"steamid": "76561198402848571", "personaname": "禽兽派工单", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/640203/", "num_games_owned": 29, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 11981, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 2, "playtime_at_review": 6803, "last_played": 1787997431, "avatar": "42316e078cbe506a2a095715df371fc9830c144d"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "这次更新很成功，成功修复了玩家可以正常进入游戏的BUG", "timestamp_created": 1719157604, "timestamp_updated": 1719157604, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.525154173374176025", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "168011841", "author": {"steamid": "76561198333907569", "personaname": "shirong890226", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/helvereynold/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 16924, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_r